    chore: sync release/2026-11-12 back to main (#4873)
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): truncate oversized skill content (#4834)
    
    * fix(kap-server): bind the main agent when a session is created (#4839)
    
    * fix(kap-server): bind the main agent when a session is created
    
    * fix(kap-server): reject a profile on prompt submissions
    
    * fix(kap-server): reject a profile change through the session profile
    
    * fix(kap-server): wait for model configuration before binding a new session
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): deduplicate restored task notifications (#4836)
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): deduplicate restored task notifications
    
    * chore: add notification replay fix changeset
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): preserve task notifications after prompt-only crashes
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): complete prompts before ending turns
    
    * test: align lifecycle snapshots with prompt completion order
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): settle all prompts during turn finalization
    
    * fix(kap-server): drop reserved metadata keys from session profile updates (#4842)
    
    * fix(kap-server): drop reserved metadata keys from session profile updates
    
    * fix(kap-server): keep stored reserved metadata keys on profile updates
    
    * docs: split and rewrite the server API reference (#4841)
    
    * docs: split and rewrite the server API reference
    
    * docs: redirect old server API anchors to the split pages
    
    * docs: describe profile metadata as a replacement
    
    * docs: mark question responses as answered-only
    
    * fix(kap-server): avoid heartbeat timeout after scheduling stalls (#4823)
    
    * fix(kap-server): avoid heartbeat timeout reaping after stalls or clock jumps
    
    * fix(kap-server): grace heartbeat window for short scheduling stalls
    
    * fix(kap-server): treat only clearly late heartbeats as scheduling stalls
    
    * fix(kap-server): time heartbeats on a monotonic clock and drain queued input before reaping
    
    ---------
    
    Co-authored-by: Kimi Code (Grok Bot) <kimi-code-grok-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
    
    * fix(kap-server): undo a turn only once when requests race (#4846)
    
    * docs: describe heartbeat stall handling (#4849)
    
    * docs: describe heartbeat stall handling
    
    * docs: explain the monotonic clock in the heartbeat notes
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): acquire session lock before loop restoration (#4848)
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): acquire session lock before loop restoration
    
    * chore: add session lock lifecycle changeset
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): hold session lock through loop restoration
    
    - add an operation-scoped lease to the session run gate
    - hold it across loop initialization, reset, and pending drains
    - cover idle timeout and release ordering
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): keep the output of stopped tool calls (#4854)
    
    * fix(kap-server): drop the partial reply of a retried step (#4855)
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): dedupe historical tool schemas (#4862)
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): dedupe historical tool schemas
    
    * chore: add duplicate tool schema changeset
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): preserve first tool schema declaration
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): remind on changed tool schemas
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): block stale tool schema calls
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): normalize registry schemas in pending checks
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): import registry tool metadata type
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): preserve abort handling during validation
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): refine validation hook preparation
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): make validation hooks synchronous
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): preserve tool result notes on fork (#4867)
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): preserve tool result notes on fork
    
    * chore: add fork tool result note changeset
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): scope tool result note restoration to forks
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): normalize inherited tool result notes
    
    * fix(agent-core-v2): isolate fork note restoration
    
    * feat(tui): sweep running titles toward text and add KIMI_CODE_TUI_ANIMATION_FPS (#4843) (#4870)
    
    * chore: sync web dist from code-app (#4871)
    
